  "summary_insights": [
    "Revenue shows significant momentum, with 2024 year-to-date (11 months) reaching £376,314 compared to the December 2023 baseline.",
    "The business maintains a healthy mix of recurring revenue, with retainers accounting for approximately 63% of total 2024 billings.",
